/**
 * Main diagram shell shared by all five view kinds.
 *
 * Renders a single ReactFlow canvas with a floating toolbar (top-left view
 * selector, top-right routing/settings), a legend toggle button sitting
 * as a hamburger directly above the built-in Controls (bottom-left pan/zoom
 * cluster), and
 * an optional legend overlay.
 *
 * For v2 ViewModel kinds (tree/interconnection/action/state) the dedicated
 * v2 FlowView components handle ELK layout internally.
 * SimulationView drives the same v2 StateFlowView with a Play/Step overlay.
 *
 * Also provides: "Auto" mode in the view-kind select (the kind it resolved to
 * is named on the select's tooltip); highlightNode message → fitView + pulse;
 * node click → navigate; edge click → mark the relation and both its ends;
 * per-view legend, build-failure / truncation / nothing-to-draw banners, and
 * legend toggle persistence.
 */

